Z||000008||Fformula88||10-23-2000||08:48 PM||||Wait a sec JohnnyK... you already voted once!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  <P>Don't get too dissappointed about those ponies yet.  Its the same engine that is in the Celica GT, which means the 180 HP Yamaha motor in the GTS should also fit.  I cannot imagine that they wouldn't go for more HP in the car.  Toyota is probably waiting a couple years since they will have enough interest for now with their limited production numbers.  ||||reg||10
